g all the time ... we just have so much fun together and I'm authentically myself,\" Taylor said.\n\nVirginia Miller and Devin Buckley, Season 8\n\nVirginia Miller and Devin Buckley made it to the altar in season 8, but when it came time to say \"I do,\" the bride chose to instead walk away from the relationship and told him she was \"just not ready.\"\n\nShe shared to the cameras later that there were \"depths of our relationship we didn't get"
