9) and Kovi Novia in \"Guava Island\" alongside Donald Glover and Letitia Wright. She also wrote \"Lift Me Up\" for \"Black Panther: Wakanda Forever\" (2022).\n\nLudacris\n\nThe rapper began his music career with hits like \"Stand Up"
