dn't be retried for Clarkson's murder until 2009. The retrial found the legendary record producer guilty of 2nd degree murder and subsequently sentenced him to 19 years to life in prison alongside ordering restitution payments to be made to Clarkson's family. Spector died in prison on January 16, 2021 with his once prodigious musical legacy entirely decimated.\n\nMartha Stewart's prison sentence\n\nIn 2003, the American television personality and businesswoman was indicted on charges of conspiracy, obstruction of justice, and securities fraud due to her involvement in"
