nt or theme park (21%), go on a hike or bicycle ride (19%), and go to a winery, brewery, or distillery (18%).\n\n- 31% of respondents said inflation, airfare prices, and personal financial situation still greatly impact their travel decisions.\n\n- Majority of Americans plan to spend the same amount of money as they did last summer (53%). However, 22%"
