ut taking permission from the Inspector General of Police (IG) at Surulere, Lagos.\n\nFilmography\n\n**Table 1**\n\n| Year | Film | Role | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1999 | Visa to hell | | |\n| 2000 | Girls Hostel | |"
