 R&B-infused pop music and impressive vocal range.\n\nYou May Also Read: All Women Collaboration in Music That Were Awesome!\n\nShe then decided to focus on her music as she was gaining more and more success with her sophomore album, 'My Everything', establishing her as a pop star. This album was released in 2014 and gave us several hits like \u2013 the uptempo-d"
