\n\nHoliday Feast Without The Hassle: Golden Corral\u00ae Brings Back Holiday Buffet, Holiday Meals To Go and Seasonal Specials\n\nNovember 26, 2024\n\nRead More\n\nAmerica's leading buffet adds new bone-in pork roast for the holidays, three new seasonal beverages, offers complete meals now available for Thanksgiving pre-order and begins gift card bonus promotion.\n\nGolden Cor"
