ng a white dress which, in celebrity world, usually means one thing. Per People, the actress and baseball player Cole Tucker said \"I do\" on December 2nd.\n\nAlthough not much is known about the specifics of the ceremony, Hudgens wore a casual, strapless white dress. The ceremony was also attended by Hudgen's High School"
