n in Asaba, Delta State, Nigeria, on 25 May 1995. The Nollywood star is 28 years old as of 2023, and her zodiac sign is Gemini. Soso is a Nigerian citizen of African ethnicity.\n\n2. Her mother is a veteran Nollywood actress\n\nSonia Uche's mother, Uche Nancy, is a Nigerian actress, film"
