ws Corp and Fox News as laid out in the current trust.\n\nFrom multiple marriages to media moves and many grandchildren, here is a closer look at the powerful Murdoch family and their complicated dynamic.\n\nRupert Murdoch\n\nMedia mogul Rupert Murdoch was born on March 11, 1931, in Australia. His business empire began when he was just 22 years old and his father, Sir Keith Murdoch, unexpectedly"
