    "snippet": "---\ntitle: 14 Female-Founded Beauty Brands To Know\ndate: 2022-03-08\n---\nIn honor of International Women's Day (March 8) I've reached out to female founders in the world of beauty to highlight their successful businesses and get their insights on what makes them feel empowered. Keep reading to learn about some amazing female-founded beauty businesses and get their advice on how to make it as women in the entrepreneur world.\n\nBeautyblender Founder & CEO Rea Ann Silva\n\nAs an experienced makeup artist, Rae Ann used her industry expertise to create her own tool to give clients that seamless airbrushed look. That tool became the Beautyblender, which is now synonymous with must-have beauty tools.\n\nWhat makes you feel empowered?\n\nREA ANN SILVA: Health, family, food, a kick-ass executive team, and good karma.\n\nHow do you use your business to inspire women and lift up others?\n\nRAS: I tell my story about how I created Beautyblender and hope it inspires and lifts up women to follow their dreams.\n\nWhat is a favorite product of yours at the moment and why?\n\nRAS: Beautyblender's Always On Radiant Skin Tint. It's long-wear, light-weight, buildable, and completes my healthy attitude.\n\nDarya Hope Founder & CEO Darya Hope Pishevar\n\nWith a beauty brand that relies on science and technology to perfect its product formulas, Darya Hope Pishevar is creating a forward-thinking company that also hopes to better the planet with environmental and philanthropic initiatives.\n\nWhat makes you feel empowered?\n\nDARYA HOPE PISHEVAR: While grit and determination help, more often than not, success comes down to the people with whom we choose to spend our time. I feel most empowered when I'm with my close circle of friends who are on their own entrepreneurial journeys like me. We celebrate the good times and console one another during the challenging ones. And they make the moments in between feel like I can achieve anything.\n\nHow do you use your business to inspire women and lift up others?\n\nDHP: I created Darya Hope to give women and men confidence in their own skin by formulating high-performance products grounded in science that harness your skin's natural ability to heal itself, as nature intended. As a founder in my 20s, I hope to share my story, inspire women to pursue their passion at any age, and encourage them to put their ideas into motion. As CEO, I also get to play a significant role"
