  "text": "---\ntitle: Sonia Uche Biography: Early Life, Education, Career, Filmography, Award, Age & Net Worth\nauthor: Etz Jayprinz\ndate: 2023-06-21\n---\nSonia Uche Biography: Ihuoma Sonia Uche, known better as Sonia Uche, is a fast-rising Nigerian Nollywood actress, entertainer, entrepreneur, and social media influencer.\n\nWho is Sonia Uche?\n\nSonia Uche (born May 25) is the first child and daughter of veteran movie producer, actress, costumier Uche Nancy, and the sister of the fellow actress Chinenye Nnebe.\n\nShe's indeed a fast-rising Nollywood actress and aspiring filmmaker.\n\nSonia Uche is a fast-rising Nollywood actress. She is the first child and daughter of a veteran movie producer, actress, Uche Nancy, and the sister of fellow actress Chinenye Nnebe.\n\nWhat do you know about Sonia Uche's Biography? Well, MideVibez uncovers every detail!\n\nSonia Uche Early Life\n\nSonia Uche was born on the 25th of May. Her exact year of birth, however, is not known.\n\nShe is a native of Delta State, and she grew up there. She is the first of four girls, one of which is Chinenye Nnebe, a famous Nollywood actress.\n\nSonia Uche is the daughter of renowned costumier and producer \u2013 Uche Nancy. She was raised along with her siblings by their mother.\n\nSonia Uche Career\n\nSonia Uche started performing at an early age, and despite having a mother who is a well-known actress, an acting career wasn't handed to her as she had to sort things out for herself. She did, however, confess that acting was not a natural fit for her and that she had to go through several auditions before earning a role in \"Complicated.\"\n\nShe went for numerous auditions, and in her first year at the university, she finally landed a role in her debut movie titled 'Complicated,' a movie in which veteran actors like Olu Jacobs, Patience Ozokwor, Yemi Black, and Juliet Ibrahim also starred. She saw the audition notice for aspiring actors between the ages of 18 and 35 on Facebook, and she went for it and got her first movie role in Abuja.\n\nShe rose to prominence after starring as the lead in \"My Boss' Daughter Movie.\"\n\nSonia Uche noted that this movie was particularly challenging as she had to embody the personality of the role she was given entirely to incorporate her essence of her completely.\n\nHer part in \"Frank's Wife\" is also well-known. She has been in over 80 films and is actively working on more. She has appeared in numerous of her mother's films, including \"My Boss' Daughter\" and \"Vanity,\" where she co-starred with her sister.\n\nSonia Uche became very famous after starring in \"My Boss' Daughter Movie.\" She is also well-known for her role in the movie \"Frank's Wife.\" In the same film, she has acted alongside her mother and her sister, Chinenye Nnebe, some of which are \"My Boss' Daughter\" and \"Vanity.\"\n\nThe young actress Sonia Uche stated that her idol in the movie industry is Genevieve Nnaji. Also, she has featured alongside other stars, including Olu Jacobs, Patience Ozokwor, Peter Edochie, Mercy Johnson, and Ken Erics, among others.\n\nEntrepreneurship\n\nAside from acting, she is also an entrepreneur with a hairline called Sonia Hair Extensions, where she deals with all kinds of human hair, frontal and braided wigs.\n\nSonia Uche Personal Life\n\nSonia Uche is the daughter of renowned costumier and producer- Uche Nancy.\n\nShe is currently single and not engaged in any relationship. However, when questioned about it, she stated that she wishes to 'take her time as her parent's divorce affected her mentally.\n\nShe is not married, has no husband, no boyfriend posted on the media, and has no child.\n\nSonia Uche Filmography\n\n- My Pains (2019)\n\n- Pain of Love (2020)\n\n- Betrayed (2020)\n\n- The Chosen One (2020)\n\n- Test of Love (2020)\n\n- Not Just a Ring (2020)\n\n- Obsession (2021)\n\n- Vanity (2021)\n\n- Pride of the Land (2021)\n\n- Storms in Marriage (2021)\n\n- Akachi (2021)\n\n- Naked Lies (2021)\n\n- War Front (2021)\n\nSonia Uche Media Controversy\n\nWho is Sonia Uche Husband?\n\nSonia Uche is currently single and not engaged in any relationship. However, when questioned about it, she stated that she wishes to 'take her time as her parent's divorce affected her mentally.\n\nDoes Sonia Uche Have A Child?\n\nIs Sonia Uche married? She is not married, has no husband, no boyfriend posted on the media, and has no child.\n\nAre Sonia Uche And Chinenye Related?\n\nYes, actress Chinenya Nnebe is Sonia Uche's younger sister; both are Nollywood actresses courtesy of their mother, Nollywood producer Nancy Uche.\n\nWhat Are The Names Of Sonia Uche Sisters?\n\n- Ijeoma Nnebe\n\n- Pretty Omah\n\n- Chinenye Nnebe\n\nMy growing up wasn't pleasant, said Sonia Uche in an interview\n\nIluoma Sonia Uche may have had an unpleasant childhood due to her parent's divorce, but this has not taken away her passion for acting.\n\nSince she ventured into Nollywood, the lead actress in My Boss' Daughter has not looked back. In this exclusive interview, the role interpreter talks about her journey to stardom.\n\n\"I got into acting through an audition. I saw the audition notice for aspiring actors between 18 and 35 on Facebook. I was at 100 Level and about to write my first semester exams. Luckily, the audition was going to be held after my exams. So, I went to Abuja for the audition, and two weeks later, I was invited to play a role in the movie, Complicated. That was my first gig. I played the role of a niece to Uncle Olu Jacob's wife in the movie. In the movie, patience Ozokwor, Yemi Black, Juliet Ibrahim, and other veterans also starred.\n\n\"Before acting, I was schooling. I was in my first year in school when I decided to go into acting.\n\n\"Soon-to-be-married? (Laughs). I never said I am soon-to-be-married. I am a child of divorce, so I'll say this: If partners realize that they are not compatible with each other, separation should be perfectly fine (for them). I think divorce is the way if things are getting out of hand. It's better to be separated than kill each other, either physically or mentally.\"\n\nSonia Uche Awards\n\nAs at the time of the publication of this article, Sonia Uche has no awards yet.\n\nSonia Uche Age\n\nOn the 25th of May, Sonia Uche was born. Her precise birth year, however, is unknown.\n\nSonia Uche Social Media\n\nFollow Sonia Uche on all her social media platforms:\n\nSonia Uche's Net Worth\n\nAltogether, Sonia's net worth is estimated to be between $100,000 and $150,000. As you may have imagined, she earns her net worth from her fast-growing career in the Nigerian movie industry as an actress.",
