c relationship for fear that it would end. I finally took the leap and did go out on a date when I was in my late 20s. I am still learning to be comfortable but my partner is very kind and I appreciate him!\"\n\n3. \"I'm the child of two people who should have gotten divorced and I'll tell you I spent a long time hating my dad for not being a 'good' dad. And just as long asking my mom when she would leave my dad"
