uring an appearance on Sherri, Hardict told host Sherri Sheperd that the four are them are \"a family\" despite his and Mowry's divorce.\n\n\"If you really love your children, you won't get involved in the noise or the mess,\" he continued, per People. \"I make sure that I always think about them first. I put myself last. If you do that, you're going to avoid the mess.\"\n\n-\n\nLisa Bonet & Lenny Kravitz\n\nActress Lisa Bonet and rocker Lenny Krav"
